# horde scene (vector, meters) — STRESS test field for vat_horde benchmark.
# Big open field so 50k agents fit without overlap. Nav cell 1.0 (coarse, cheap
# Dijkstra over 200x200 cells); collision grid is independent (~2*r). Goal band
# at the top so the prefilled crowd streams toward it (congestion = worst case).
# Use with VAT_HORDE_FILL=N VAT_HORDE_BENCH="warmup,measure".
cell 1.0
world 200 200
set k_density 2.5
set k_jam 6

spawn 2 2 196 6
goal 80 196 40 3
